    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Consider the unbalanced chemical equation below: $\\text{P}_4(\\text{s}) + \\text{H}_2(\\text{g}) \\rightarrow \\text{PH}_3(\\text{g})$\n\nWhich ONE of the sets of coefficients will balance the chemical equation?\n\nA. 4, 2, 3\nB. 1, 6, 4\nC. 1, 4, 4\nD. 2, 10, 8"
